### 7. a number this receipt got wrong, and the correction
The first scan of the saving said FOURTEEN PRs would stop paying. It used a
narrower trigger set than the classifier that shipped: it did not count
`.github/**` or `scripts/dogfood/**` as reaching a gate.

The shipped classifier is the conservative one — a change to the lane itself, or
to either gate's own script, selects — and against it the figure is TEN. Section
4 above is that run, against the classifier in this commit, over the 25 PRs
merged as of cddf78cd. Ten, not fourteen, is the number in the code comments,
the roadmap, the commit message and the issue.

PMAT-542-LOG-END
